$ MacNeal & Harder (1985), Sec. 4 - twisted cantilever beam.
$ Length L = 12, cross-section 1.1 (width) x 0.32 (thickness), twisted 90
$ deg from root to tip. E = 29.0e6, nu = 0.22.
$ Mesh: 12 CQUAD4 along length, 1 across width (26 nodes total).
$ Twist at station i (i=0..12): theta_i = (i/12) * pi/2 .
$
$ OUT-OF-PLANE load case. At the tip (station 12) the 1.1 width lies along
$ global Z and the 0.32 thickness along global Y, so the out-of-plane
$ direction at the loaded end is +Y. Total tip load P = 1.
$ Reference (out-of-plane, P = 1 at tip): Uy = 1.754e-3.
$ The companion in-plane case (+Z, Uz = 5.424e-3) is twisted_beam.bdf.
$ Both reference values: MacNeal & Harder 1985 Table 3, restated in Ko, Lee &
$ Bathe 2017, Comput. Struct. 193, Sec. 3.5 for t/L = 0.02667.
$
SOL 101
CEND
TITLE = MacNeal-Harder twisted cantilever beam (out-of-plane load)
SUBCASE 1
  LABEL = Out-of-plane unit tip load Fy at the free end
  SPC = 1
  LOAD = 1
  DISPLACEMENT = ALL
BEGIN BULK
$ ---- solver parameters ----
$ Drilling-DOF stabilisation is not part of the benchmark definition and
$ solvers default it differently (MSC/Nastran 70.5 SOL 101: 0.0; MSC.Nastran
$ 2004+ and OpenJFEM: 100.0). Pinned so the accuracy and same-deck parity
$ comparisons are parameter-exact. See validation/README.md, "PARAM,K6ROT".
PARAM,K6ROT,0.
MAT1, 1, 2.9+7, , 0.22
PSHELL, 1, 1, 0.32, 1
$ ---- station 0 (theta=0 deg) ----
GRID, 1, , 0.0, -0.55000,  0.00000
GRID, 2, , 0.0,  0.55000,  0.00000
$ ---- station 1 (theta=7.5 deg) ----
GRID, 3, , 1.0, -0.54527, -0.07178
GRID, 4, , 1.0,  0.54527,  0.07178
$ ---- station 2 (theta=15 deg) ----
GRID, 5, , 2.0, -0.53126, -0.14235
GRID, 6, , 2.0,  0.53126,  0.14235
$ ---- station 3 (theta=22.5 deg) ----
GRID, 7, , 3.0, -0.50815, -0.21048
GRID, 8, , 3.0,  0.50815,  0.21048
$ ---- station 4 (theta=30 deg) ----
GRID, 9, , 4.0, -0.47631, -0.27500
GRID,10, , 4.0,  0.47631,  0.27500
$ ---- station 5 (theta=37.5 deg) ----
GRID,11, , 5.0, -0.43638, -0.33484
GRID,12, , 5.0,  0.43638,  0.33484
$ ---- station 6 (theta=45 deg) ----
GRID,13, , 6.0, -0.38891, -0.38891
GRID,14, , 6.0,  0.38891,  0.38891
$ ---- station 7 (theta=52.5 deg) ----
GRID,15, , 7.0, -0.33484, -0.43638
GRID,16, , 7.0,  0.33484,  0.43638
$ ---- station 8 (theta=60 deg) ----
GRID,17, , 8.0, -0.27500, -0.47631
GRID,18, , 8.0,  0.27500,  0.47631
$ ---- station 9 (theta=67.5 deg) ----
GRID,19, , 9.0, -0.21048, -0.50815
GRID,20, , 9.0,  0.21048,  0.50815
$ ---- station 10 (theta=75 deg) ----
GRID,21, ,10.0, -0.14235, -0.53126
GRID,22, ,10.0,  0.14235,  0.53126
$ ---- station 11 (theta=82.5 deg) ----
GRID,23, ,11.0, -0.07178, -0.54527
GRID,24, ,11.0,  0.07178,  0.54527
$ ---- station 12 (theta=90 deg, tip) ----
GRID,25, ,12.0,  0.00000, -0.55000
GRID,26, ,12.0,  0.00000,  0.55000
$ ---- elements ----
CQUAD4, 1, 1, 1, 3, 4, 2
CQUAD4, 2, 1, 3, 5, 6, 4
CQUAD4, 3, 1, 5, 7, 8, 6
CQUAD4, 4, 1, 7, 9,10, 8
CQUAD4, 5, 1, 9,11,12,10
CQUAD4, 6, 1,11,13,14,12
CQUAD4, 7, 1,13,15,16,14
CQUAD4, 8, 1,15,17,18,16
